{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：17:30 2026-10-20 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"劉鑾雄女兒劉秀盈賀24歲生日  港大碩士畢業文武雙全  網民：笑容和爸爸一樣\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6ca574cb54c17157b93eefb5a51a283/2026-10/ENT___19.png\"/>\n<p>富商劉鑾雄（大劉）的「學霸」女兒劉秀盈（Aspen），早前透露已順利完成香港大學建築系碩士論文，又隨香港芭蕾舞劇團隨團到各地演出，其音外才華亦不容忽視，可謂才貌雙全。劉秀盈轉眼間已經24歲，昨日（19日）在社交平台分享慶祝照片，越大越靚。</p>\n<h2>劉秀盈笑容甜美</h2>\n<p>劉秀盈昨日在IG分享慶祝生日的照片，獲不少網民送上祝福。相中的劉秀盈戴上「BIRTHDAY GIRL」頭箍，對着插有「24」歲蠟燭的千層酥蛋糕展露甜美笑容，散發出少女的青春氣息。而劉秀盈的身後見到未有露面的一男一女，估計是其母親及弟弟劉子鋒。另外，亦有網民指劉秀盈的笑容和爸爸一樣。</p>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈是富商「大劉」劉鑾雄的女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d7c60e109a63aff8f0f10215b996e06/2023-01/SAUYING7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈曾翻唱《分分鐘需要你》送給爸爸大劉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cbbafef0bb47b9471f48487fc507a3f9/2022-12/papa_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈今年7月曾晒照片，為富商爸爸「大劉」劉鑾雄慶祝75歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7ba9b7fe1f3ca34377687977518ef37/2026-10/Aspen_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈已經24歲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38d3c18e2457505a5daf3f238ea593bc/2026-10/Aspen_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈昨日（19日）在IG分享慶祝24歲的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d858b2de4b07257fd6cb599201cc951/2026-10/Aspen_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈日前分享12年前的影片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a12bf9f5a6adf333c8290304c2df122/2026-10/Aspen_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈學習功夫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e130fb6f354c3889e9aa1d9c98c0f89/2026-10/Aspen_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈招式有板有眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fed50a5d2c2b416c6fb4bbb18c09266/2026-10/Aspen_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈展現功架。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b96132dd93eb61da2f8ee8d5233c3ef/2026-10/Aspen_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈平衡力極好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be8fe5913f1c0e04ec404a5db99df307/2026-10/Aspen_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈為練舞練功夫，下了不少苦工。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/77f330c22c146d9808854d721099dfad/2026-10/Aspen_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈從小已展現藝術天份。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4890354a2c80164a1ad49132692b6289/2026-06/Aspen_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈小時候很可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3880431ed5d999f1e19be611cca9ed32/2024-03/VS--AspenaspenlaumusicInstagram-0_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈早前在社交網自揭已經改名。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef01e085875f80addbcc85e6963158df/2024-03/403722329_1986803205053578_4487734305092873900_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈曾分享側面童年照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f7d7813712d571e861f203f3785b3d61/2023-01/luikwan36.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈分享兩張年幼時的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/30a72f965a6325a1dfcc3551268ef66f/2023-01/KakaoTalk_20230122_192812126.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈已完成香港大學建築系碩士課程。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/71d83212602ab584f97431ca73c2d415/2024-03/Aspen_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈越大越靚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/994af2a714d50dfb980dc1a160dbd37c/2023-10/aspenlaumusic_1697681111_3216704762645386743_4477713492.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈文武雙全。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72521ddd82f08e2b3daf219b9ed0a49c/2024-10/aspenlaumusic_1729317318_3482088502614060550_4477713492.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈晒出在舞蹈學校的相片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51ad7860acb2a66670439745a2ccbe89/2026-06/Aspen_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈透過音樂培養韌性。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f8608d59b4e540a0445d8c3f68ad3d8/2026-06/Aspen_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈熱愛音樂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/057b031580d9055281845608117962b0/2023-01/luikwan35.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈大晒才藝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d37086b2287dca77d9e73e7010fe252b/2024-03/Aspen_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈才華洋溢，除了識結他、鋼琴、芭蕾舞，近來更學小提琴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31939de8d06f9c122b1b795ee5133ef1/2024-03/Aspen_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈音樂造詣高。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4126f45f6c6124f554498098aac54fb/2024-10/VS--AspenaspenlaumusicInstagram-0_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈彈琴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72164708baa54dde646aabead7452334/2025-09/3__3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈早前扮小魚仙遊上海迪士尼樂園。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21231ff5bc6c4f31a4627503a9a3034d/2023-07/1000g0082o2q6bi0js00g5o75pc20bhds7i6e2g0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈試過在英國扮Elsa睇《Frozen》音樂劇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d51cfc803b0b919bb0a951f14ed8e3b/2023-01/day4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈一身公主裝到迪士尼城堡前打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b493a47da9f884b399b75d28a8cc7ca/2023-07/1000g0082o2rra16ju0005o75pc20bhdscul57hg.jpg\"/>\n<p>劉秀盈日前又分享另一張慶祝照片，見到在教室內有一個巨大「精靈球」（Pokémon Ball）造型扑扑蛋糕（Smash Cake），周圍放滿精美的小紙杯蛋糕，相信是與跟隨劉秀盈學芭蕾舞的學生一齊開派對。劉秀盈在帖文中表示，慶祝生日最好的方式，就是與其喜愛的小芭蕾舞蹈員一起度過。</p>\n<h2>劉秀盈文武雙全</h2>\n<p>文武雙全的劉秀盈，自小多才多藝，不但是芭蕾舞高手，於「國際芭蕾舞比賽2023」中勇奪公開組金獎，更熱愛武術，在功夫比賽上摘金。日前劉秀盈在IG分享自己在2014年習武的影片，從基本功到高難度的一字馬踢腿動作，都應付自如，可見其筋骨之柔軟和多年來付出的努力。</p>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈早前透露已順利完成香港大學建築系碩士論文。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b3701bc623bbba696a42116ded72f89/2026-06/Aspen_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈去年曾展出作品及設計圖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/162604e34f002aa9efecce14cefd0710/2026-06/Aspen_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈曾晒出利用電繪圖的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f6ae794cfb0129164142a72be37ee68/2025-09/2__4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈公開畢業論文的設計建築圖則。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f7e82700659c4ff80cd149cce8d0173/2026-06/Aspen_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈的畢業論文製作模型。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2934d476aa1e3b847afe8dc5b8ac266/2026-06/Aspen_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈早前宣布創業做老闆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/407960c063e6c363ef5f6a9ca79e7ca1/2023-03/unknown_337898186_910917493292250_4898611229994092909_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈在黃竹坑開辦8,000呎的舞蹈學校。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07b27bc3cbe0fd5178eb937841670a9e/2024-03/123_2__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈門口可容納不少家長等候。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ccd6877a432ad7388c7b8a1f619c461/2024-03/123_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈的舞蹈學校走實而不華路線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0af76d6600bd1fb164597a6b524d867/2024-03/123_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈榮升老闆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9020b49e5907f68d40af3c29abe11a9e/2024-03/123_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈的舞蹈學校裝修簡約明亮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44e196c7850ba41084698bf8daad8f33/2024-03/123_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈的舞蹈學校空間感十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/160684fd9190a4af142afa5697b4d80b/2024-03/123_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈的舞蹈學校，可作多方面用途。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe1cbcdabf2a0b63611db749e2f2e615/2024-03/123_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈將興趣變成事業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f13e35acbe69d7776b5e05594e59cb14/2024-03/123_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"香港舞蹈劇場IG上載劉秀盈穿上芭蕾舞衣，擺出劈腿的舞蹈姿勢，同時邊拉小提琴，將兩項才華融合。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/931c9c98fae84be0efb3730e4b5ffa83/2024-03/hkdancetheatre_1710335966_3322861381140554610_63159503209.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈多才多藝，被網民封為才女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60cecfa9cefd90c30b0aabe194bdf614/2023-01/luikwan32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈熱愛芭蕾舞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24ac4d7cf4e1cb2feab8976acebd63ef/2023-01/SAUYING9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈曾在國際芭蕾舞比賽中奪得金獎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50016822cc942e11b69451b07f7a7d7a/2023-01/luikwan38.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈熱愛芭蕾舞，不惜苦練。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/acb76cdac3434d4717fcd173510dadc8/2023-03/unknown_329037651_1232917620915937_1434543056018207740_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈熱愛舞蹈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0da0357969cd41340a4c710d23933b61/2023-01/SAUYING19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈曾在果欄擺芭蕾舞甫士拍硬照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4baa9cab1c2730ed4ed9b018b2f3da32/2022-12/ballet_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈樣子似媽咪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6809ad05586f7843057fbe0de915be61/2022-10/4_116.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈好有音樂天份。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e911db613a0328ab56c191147710749/2022-10/12_1_25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"多才多藝的劉秀盈還會唱歌彈琴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1962530ef3632a3187554e851aa9e451/2022-12/music.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈好有氣質。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/393e53e8e96eb168b38ec22a602035ce/2024-03/Aspen_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈擺好芭蕾舞姿勢打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d3a96734b966a07de805f53c6e160546/2024-03/Aspen_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉秀盈不時參與表演。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2914bbc161ccd0600d6c569a5deb761d/2024-03/Aspen_8_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:01:52.513457+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":571,"images":57,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T14:38:39.093856+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T13:58:02.806977+00:00","content_hash":"7cd4d81b2736aaea5a499dbdb03a5cb81abddb840ab895a881b3d578a5600dba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}